  "heading": "Kinds of courts-martial.",
  "chapter": null,
  "order": 108,
  "text": "For the purposes of this Act there shall be four kinds of courtsmartial, that is to say,--\n\n(a) general courts-martial;\n\n(b) district courts-martial;\n\n(c) summary general courts-martial; and\n\n(d) summary courts-martial.",
